# evals/results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. A probe or eval run is evidence
# for a model-selection decision, and the decision is only defensible if the
# numbers behind it are in the history next to it.

# Agent tooling, ignored for now rather than on principle. settings.local.json
# is a local permissions override and belongs to this machine either way, but
# .claude/skills/ is project tooling and is a real decision that has been
# deferred, not made. Revisit before the repo goes public: shipping it says
# something about how the site was built, and so does leaving it out.
.claude/
